      "source": "Executes the given <a href=\"ReactiveSessionCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ReactiveSessionCallback</code></a> within the <code>ClientSession</code>.\n<br/>\nIt is up to the caller to make sure the <code>ClientSession</code> is <code>closed</code> when done.",
      "translation": "在给定的 <a href=\"ReactiveSessionCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ReactiveSessionCallback</code></a> 中执行操作，该操作在 <code>ClientSession</code> 上下文中进行。  \n<br/>\n调用者需自行确保在完成操作后关闭 <code>ClientSession</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
