      "source": "Gateway interface to execute <code>ClientSession</code> bound operations against MongoDB via a\n<a href=\"ReactiveSessionCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ReactiveSessionCallback</code></a>.",
      "translation": "网关接口，用于通过 <a href=\"ReactiveSessionCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ReactiveSessionCallback</code></a> 执行与 MongoDB 绑定的 <code>ClientSession</code> 操作。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>doFinally</code> - callback object that accepts <code>ClientSession</code> after invoking <a href=\"ReactiveSessionCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ReactiveSessionCallback</code></a>.\n         This <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Consumer</code></a> is guaranteed to be notified in any case (successful and exceptional outcome of\n         <a href=\"ReactiveSessionCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ReactiveSessionCallback</code></a>).",
      "translation": "<code>doFinally</code> - 回调对象，在调用<a href=\"ReactiveSessionCallback.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.ReactiveSessionCallback 接口\"><code>ReactiveSessionCallback</code></a>后接收 <code>ClientSession</code>。此<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"java.util.function.Consumer 类或接口\"><code>Consumer</code></a>保证在任何情况下（无论 <a href=\"ReactiveSessionCallback.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.ReactiveSessionCallback 接口\"><code>ReactiveSessionCallback</code></a> 的结果是成功还是异常）都会被通知。",
      "count": 1
    },
